# ============================================================
# 版本控制范围 / What is version-controlled
#
# 原则：代码、文档、图件、聚合结果全部公开；
#       受许可限制或体积过大的原始/中间数据不入库，改在 DATA.md 中给出获取方式。
# Principle: all code, documentation, figures and aggregated results are public;
# licence-restricted or bulky raw data stay out and are documented in DATA.md.
# ============================================================

# ---- 原始数据：体积 10 GB，且部分受再分发限制 -------------------
# Raw data: 10 GB, and partly redistribution-restricted
02_data_raw/

# ---- IUCN 衍生的物种级数据 -------------------------------------
# IUCN Red List spatial data may not be redistributed, and a species-by-cell
# presence matrix is a reformatting of it rather than an aggregate summary.
# Per-cell aggregated metrics (no species identities) are included.
03_data_derived/comm_*.rds
03_data_derived/ranges_albers_*.gpkg
03_data_derived/splist_*.rds
03_data_derived/traits_china_raw.rds
03_data_derived/traits_imputed.rds
03_data_derived/amphibian_observed_traits.rds
# 物种级性状与功能轴分数：含由 IUCN 分布图导出的 range_size，
# 与 traits_imputed.rds 同属物种级衍生数据，按同一政策不入库。
# 全部可由 01_code/03*.R 从公开来源重建。
# Species-level trait and axis tables carry an IUCN-derived range_size and are
# excluded under the same policy; all are rebuilt by 01_code/03*.R.
03_data_derived/traits_core.rds
03_data_derived/traits_lifehistory.rds
03_data_derived/trait_axes_species.rds
03_data_derived/functional_axes_species.rds

# ---- 中间缓存：可由代码重建 -------------------------------------
# Caches: fully reproducible from the code
04_results/cache/
04_results/models/
07_logs/

# ---- 体积过大的底图副本 ----------------------------------------
03_data_derived/basemap_珊瑚礁.gpkg
03_data_derived/basemap_0-15KM缓冲国界.gpkg

# ---- 系统与运行时 ----------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.DS_Store
_scout/
*.log
*.tar.gz

# 本地代理配置与散落文件 / local agent config and stray files
.claude/
Rplots.pdf
